    "intro_html":  "Minestrone was never a recipe so much as a strategy: whatever vegetables you have, plus beans, plus a little pasta, in a good broth. This version leans on hot Italian sausage for depth, chickpeas and artichoke hearts for body, and green beans and tomatoes for the rest. It carries 33 grams of protein for about $3.97 a bowl (at everyday cost).",
